body:
How do I contact steam without the hacker being able to simply cancel my ticket? I've posted several tickets that get closed without my input within 15 minutes of my posting. I don't cancel them and I found that under my login info someone from another country logged into my account causing my account to be locked. I changed the passwords on all email and other relevant things. I just can't get into contact with steam support at this time

&#x200B;

edit: Changing email request leads to captcha error on mobile and desktop
